# Finish environment setup at the Save click

When setting up or updating a Cloud Agent environment, the agent's work ends when the only remaining action is the user's Save click. Do not stop at a status report while that click is still required.

- Validate install locally, snapshot, run the draft build, and verify that build when those tools are available.
- Call `propose-environment-json` with the successful build id so the Environment panel shows Save on that turn.
- If a later check finds the environment is still unsaved, propose the tested scripts and build id again in that same turn.
- The user clicks Save. Do not claim the environment is saved before that click.
